          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Actual slope classification",
          "inputProfile": "text",
          "expected": "undefined"
        }
      ],
      "solutionReview": {
        "headline": "The student confused zero rise with zero run.",
        "reasoning": [
          "Here x does not change, so the run is 0.",
          "Slope is rise divided by run; division by 0 is undefined, so the vertical line's slope is undefined."
        ]
      },
      "attemptFeedback": [
        "Check whether the unchanging coordinate causes the numerator or denominator of rise/run to be zero."
      ],
      "supportHints": [
        "Zero rise gives slope 0; zero run gives undefined slope."
